ccentricity_le_card {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n37:     (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (v : V) (hrad : GraphCalc.HasRadius G) :\n38:     GraphCalc.eccentricity G v ≤ Fintype.card V := by\n39:   unfold GraphCalc.eccentricity\n40:   apply minUpTo_le (Fintype.card V) (le_refl _) (hrad v)\n41: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
